# Owned disposable VM only. 32767 is the lab companion/fixture UID, not product policy.
pass out quick on lo0 inet proto tcp from 127.0.0.1 to 127.0.0.1 port 18084 user RELAY_UID flags S/SA keep state label "aegvium-sender-allow"
block return out quick on lo0 inet proto tcp from any to 127.0.0.1 port 18084 label "aegvium-sender-deny"
pass out quick on lo0 inet proto tcp from 127.0.0.1 to 127.0.0.1 port 18086:18087 user 32767 flags S/SA keep state label "aegvium-backend-allow"
block return out quick on lo0 inet proto tcp from any to 127.0.0.1 port 18086:18087 label "aegvium-backend-deny"
pass all no state
